## Third-party data

`data/official-synthetic/` is the **synthetic starter pack provided by the Rise Networks
#AI4Elections Hackathon organisers**. It is redistributed here unchanged under the hackathon's
repository terms (CC BY 4.0). It is **not** our work and is **not** real election data — all records
are fictional. Attribution: Rise Networks #AI4Elections Hackathon 2026 synthetic starter pack.

