## Dependency licences

All dependencies are open source and permissively licensed: FastAPI (MIT), Uvicorn (BSD-3-Clause),
Pydantic (MIT), scikit-learn (BSD-3-Clause), NumPy (BSD-3-Clause), pytest (MIT), React (MIT),
Vite (MIT).

No dependency requires a paid account, and none is used under a licence that would restrict this
submission.
